{"id": "unknown-2026-11-11-004", "date": "2026-11-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "German utility plans 30 MWh zinc-bromine BESS", "content": "<p>Stadtwerke Gaggenau and Capac AG are planning a €15.2 million ($16.8 million) project featuring US manufacturer Eos’ stackable zinc-bromine battery technology, with construction due to begin in 2027 and commissioning scheduled for 2028.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/11/german-utility-plans-30-mwh-zinc-bromine-bess/\">German utility plans 30 MWh zinc-bromine BESS</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/11/german-utility-plans-30-mwh-zinc-bromine-bess/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-11-005", "date": "2026-11-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Saudi Arabia launches 1.9 GW PV tender", "content": "<p>Saudi authorities have announced a request for qualification for 1.8 GW of solar capacity across two projects in the eigth round of Saudi Arabia’s renewable energy procurement program. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/11/saudi-arabia-launches-1-9-gw-pv-tender/\">Saudi Arabia launches 1.9 GW PV tender</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/11/saudi-arabia-launches-1-9-gw-pv-tender/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-11-006", "date": "2026-11-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Advansor installs 1.2 MW of CO₂ heat pumps at Swedish retailer", "content": "<p>Danish manufacturer Advansor said two of its plug-and-play ValueBox heat pumps, each with a heating capacity of 600 kW, will provide heating for an entire retail building. The outdoor units feature factory-assembled components and can reportedly deliver water temperatures of up to 95 C.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/11/advansor-installs-1-2-mw-of-co%e2%82%82-heat-pumps-at-swedish-retailer/\">Advansor installs 1.2 MW of CO₂ heat pumps at Swedish retailer</a> appea", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/11/advansor-installs-1-2-mw-of-co%e2%82%82-heat-pumps-at-swedish-retailer/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-11-007", "date": "2026-11-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "CASC completes maiden flight of solar-powered UAV in China", "content": "<p>China Aerospace Science and Technology Corp. (CASC) has completed the maiden flight of its Light Cavalry solar-powered unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV). The aircraft has an 8-meter wingspan and is designed to fly continuously for up to 30 hours, targeting applications including infrastructure inspection, environmental monitoring and emergency response.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/11/casc-completes-maiden-flight-of-solar-powered-uav-in-china/\">CASC completes maide", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/11/11/casc-completes-maiden-flight-of-solar-powered-uav-in-china/", "type": "rss"}]}
